# NovaOS TV: TV channels as internet live streams.
# Only official, free streams that the broadcasters themselves publish (public
# broadcasters ARD/ZDF and a few free private channels). Most of them are only
# available in Germany (geo-blocking). Private channels such as RTL, ProSieben,
# Sat.1 or VOX have no free internet stream - they are watched through the TV's
# own tuner (antenna/cable/satellite) or their official apps.
# Attributes: tvg-chno = channel number, group-title, nova-color = tile colour.
# Checked against the curated list https://github.com/Free-TV/IPTV (Germany).
